    "en": {
      "text": "//Non-Enhanced\nKilling an <link Elite or higher-ranked Combatant [#CombatantClassifications] /> spawns a seeking insectoid robot that chases enemies within 25 meters. The insectoid deals weapon-element matching damage (varying by archetype) in a 5 meter radius.\n\n0.5 second cooldown between insectoid spawns. Insectoid kills count as weapon kills and can trigger perks, but cannot spawn more insectoids. ",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-21T18:22:53.455Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  },
